                            <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A number for the distance to move points from the surfaces
of the input _geometry.  Typically, this should be a small positive
number to ensure points are not blocked by the mesh. (Default: 10 cm
in the equivalent Rhino Model units).</item>
